#. <CLT 4>ここの棚には、食べ物が並んでいる…
#. 料理の食材からお菓子まで、よりどりみどりだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's all kinds of food here. Ingredients, snacks,\n"
"candy—it's everything anyone could ever want or need.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは料理はできないけど…
#. 少しは勉強しようかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't really know how to cook. Maybe I should try to\n"
"learn...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかし、本当にごちゃごちゃだな…
#. 少しは整理した方がいいかも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's so messy... Maybe I should try to tidy up a bit.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかし、本当にごちゃごちゃだな…
#. 少しは整理した方がいいかも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's so messy... Maybe I should try to tidy up a bit.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかし、本当にごちゃごちゃだな…
#. 少しは整理した方がいいかも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's so messy... Maybe I should try to tidy up a bit.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0006 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0007 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Không"

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>これは、冷蔵庫か…
#. …あれ、当たり付きのアイスがある。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are popsicles in the fridge. The box says if I\n"
"get a winning popsicle stick, I can win a free one...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>当たったら…モノクマが交換してくれたりして…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If I got one, would Monokuma let me trade it in...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

